    "result_text": "Done. The full suite is green (`BUILD SUCCESS`).\n\n## Summary\n\nThe `contactPreference` field is a derived value on the owner response, so I implemented it as a computed DTO field alongside the existing derived fields (`displayName`, `initials`, `locality`, etc.):\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `contactPreference` string property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` carries the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` expression: `EMAIL` when `owner.getEmail()` is present (non-null, non-blank), otherwise `PHONE`.\n\nBoth new acceptance tests pass (`PHONE` when no email, `EMAIL` when present), and the full test suite builds green.",
